CLKC-3#1 Advisory
Clock Buffer has LOC and not CLOCK_REGION  
The BUFGCE cell ooc_ap_clk_bufg has a LOC constraint, but using the CLOCK_REGION property instead would give more flexibility to the Placer to select the appropriate routing/distribution track.
Related violations: <none>


